= The Butcher of the Rim

**Wilhuff Tarkin** of Eriadu, a former officer of the Outland Regions Security Force, has crushed a pirate confederation in the Seswenna sector with breathtaking ruthlessness. The pirates are gone. So are several villages that may or may not have sheltered them. The Security Bloc has made him its champion.

- @praise: Praise his effectiveness.
- @condemn: Condemn his brutality.
- @ignore: Say nothing.

@praise
subtitle: The Security Bloc approves; the Rim is appalled.
on-arrival: sec_relation += 6; rim_relation -= 6; hawk_dissent -= 3; rimward_dissent += 5; rim_hardship -= 1

Tarkin sends a brief, correct note of thanks.

@condemn
subtitle: The Rim is grateful; the Security Bloc is not.
on-arrival: rim_relation += 5; sec_relation -= 6; pacifist_dissent -= 3; hawk_dissent += 3; faith += 0.5

Tarkin does not reply. He remembers.

@ignore

The Caucus says nothing.
